SM_Stock_OfficerSpy, by Officer Spy
  https://github.com/OfficerSpy/SM_Stock_OfficerSpy
  No licence is stated by its author.

  Releases up to and including v0.18.3 included ten of its headers, so its
  code is compiled into those .smx files. Its author has published no licence,
  so the terms covering that are unsettled.

  The includes were removed after v0.18.3 and the plugin carries none of it
  from the next release on. What replaced them is plugin/source/redbots3/game/,
